WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
The first back medium kick connects as a Counter Hit.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.200
The medium-kick follow-up hits the grounded opponent.

3
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.850
Light Renversé connects after the target sequence.

4
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.750
The Renversé finish raises Manon from two medals to three.

5
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:04.950
Ryu rises after the hit-grab knockdown.
